    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d885">

                <pb facs="1125" n="1023" xml:id="pg1023"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.11101 Waivers 81—</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Spain</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 805</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-07-02">July 2,
                        1935</date>.<lb/>[Received July 15.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to the Embassy’s despatch
                    No. 675 of February 27th last, I have the honor to report that upon the receipt
                    of a copy of Mr. Blake’s despatch to the Department, No. 1070 of June
                        17th,<anchor n="35" xml:id="d885-f1"/> entitled “Discriminatory Passport
                    Regulations in Spanish Zone of Morocco”, I took up this discrimination again
                    with the Foreign Office and have received a Note, dated July 1,<anchor n="35"
                        xml:id="d885-f2"/> in reply to my representations, a copy and translation of
                    which are enclosed herewith. This Note states that instructions have been sent
                    to the Spanish Consul General in Tangier in order that the presentation of two
                    photographs by American tourists desiring a visa may be no longer necessary.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hallett Johnson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
